gz-gaussian-splatting
Copyright 2026 Solvor Labs

This package contains original renderer and scene tooling extracted from the
Solvor Labs swarm_platform research project. It implements published Gaussian
splatting mathematics and reads the standard 3DGS/Splatfacto PLY convention.
No training code, model weights, or captured datasets are distributed.

Gazebo, Qt and Ogre-Next are external dependencies and retain their own
licenses. See docs/THIRD_PARTY.md for dependency and provenance information.
